@startuml
' Figure 10.6  The loop that ran twelve steps
' Reading order: top to bottom. Trace S018387, Monday, February 16,
' 2026, 10:04 a.m. Central time. The task needed seven steps; the loop
' searched the same flights five more times, and one search waited
' on the shared rate limit. Values from corpus.traces, seed 10.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Agent\nloop" as L <<model>>
participant "Model\nprovider" as M <<model>>
participant "Tools" as T <<ops>>
L -> M : Steps 1 to 6
M -> T : Booking, two searches
T --> L : 6.2 s of tools
group Steps 7 to 11, repeats
  L -> M : Same search
  M -[$FAIL]> L : 429, 8.2 s wait
  M -> T : search_flights
  T --> L : 10.8 s of tools
end
L -[#1A1A1A]> M : Step 12: answer
note over L : 38.4 s; 18.7 s capped
@enduml
